{"synopsis":"Shin Young-jun, seorang sersan koki, disambut oleh kiamat hanya beberapa hari sebelum liburan. Batalyon tersebut berubah menjadi kekacauan dalam sekejap, dan jaringan komunikasi terputus. Lalu sesuatu muncul di depan matanya! [Selamat atas kebangkitanmu!] [Pekerjaan: Koki Pemula Lv.1] Jika aku seorang pejuang atau pembunuh, aku akan mencoba untuk berdiri sendiri… Yang ditugaskan padanya adalah koki, yang jelas merupakan pekerjaan pendukung . Tidak ada yang bisa dilakukan jika sudah seperti ini. “Mulai sekarang, aku akan memberimu makan.”","alternative_title":"멸망한 세계의 취사병, Myeolmanghan Segyeui Chwisabyeong","author":"웨스트, 마일드커피","artist":"웨스트, 마일드커피","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"f402cf44-176e-4cf7-988b-d32adaf04dc3","number":"120","chapter":"120","title":"","date":"2026-07-08","released":"2026-07-08","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e654f8eb-d062-4bc6-89b5-ff2876a3ed5d/chapter_ch_120/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e654f8eb-d062-4bc6-89b5-ff2876a3ed5d/chapter_ch_120/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e654f8eb-d062-4bc6-89b5-ff2876a3ed5d/chapter_ch_120/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e654f8eb-d062-4bc6-89b5-ff2876a3ed5d/chapter_ch_120/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e654f8eb-d062-4bc6-89b5-ff2876a3ed5d/chapter_ch_120/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e654f8eb-d062-4bc6-89b5-ff2876a3ed5d/chapter_ch_120/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e654f8eb-d062-4bc6-89b5-ff2876a3ed5d/chapter_ch_120/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e654f8eb-d062-4bc6-89b5-ff2876a3ed5d/chapter_ch_120/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e654f8eb-d062-4bc6-89b5-ff2876a3ed5d/chapter_ch_120/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_e654f8eb-d062-4bc6-89b5-ff2876a3ed5d/chapter_ch_120/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"40a9d70d-2cab-4daa-a9ab-1cfeb1aa6890","number":"119","chapter":"119","title":"","date":"2026-07-08","released":"2026-07-08","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/c